WEBVTT

00:12.530 --> 00:20.580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

00:20.580 --> 00:28.340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

00:44.920 --> 00:46.940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

00:46.940 --> 00:50.810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

00:52.820 --> 00:54.930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

00:54.930 --> 00:58.720
♪Be brave enough to split
the primal chaos wide open♪

01:36.380 --> 01:37.620
[Pull Strings]

01:37.620 --> 01:39.380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

01:39.640 --> 01:40.930
If Changgeng

01:41.040 --> 01:42.740
could see your change today,

01:43.430 --> 01:44.900
he'd be so happy for you.

01:52.640 --> 01:53.410
Come to think of it,

01:54.040 --> 01:56.100
I must thank you for this armor.

01:56.710 --> 01:57.490
What?

01:57.710 --> 01:58.490
Well.

01:59.710 --> 02:01.330
You gave this armor to me.

02:02.400 --> 02:03.260
I did?

02:03.680 --> 02:05.100
The other day,
when the maids brought clothes,

02:05.120 --> 02:06.770
there was armor hidden inside by magic.

02:07.430 --> 02:09.570
The maids, low in power, didn't notice.

02:09.870 --> 02:10.850
They thought it was just
an ordinary garment

02:10.870 --> 02:11.730
and gave it to me.

02:14.680 --> 02:15.610
I gave it to you?

02:15.630 --> 02:17.290
As a human disciple,

02:17.590 --> 02:19.100
you're truly thoughtful.

02:19.310 --> 02:20.780
Thanks to your war armor.

02:20.800 --> 02:22.890
Otherwise, the Little Prince
would've been hurt.

02:23.030 --> 02:24.500
This armor is a real treasure,

02:24.520 --> 02:25.690
impervious to blades and spears.

02:25.710 --> 02:26.940
You kept this fine thing hidden.

02:27.190 --> 02:27.980
So composed.

02:28.520 --> 02:29.380
Back then, Your Highness,

02:29.400 --> 02:31.100
when the giant dragon pinned you down,

02:31.280 --> 02:32.690
it was also this human disciple

02:32.710 --> 02:34.100
who told me to shout to you

02:34.280 --> 02:35.500
that you should transform into a dragon.

02:36.310 --> 02:37.690
I did that?

02:37.710 --> 02:39.290
What reached my ears

02:39.310 --> 02:40.890
was your voice.

02:41.080 --> 02:42.010
The formation is complete.

02:42.280 --> 02:43.500
Tell the Little Prince to transform now.

02:44.120 --> 02:44.890
What should I say?

02:44.910 --> 02:46.610
Repeat what I say.

02:46.630 --> 02:47.940
Repeat after me, loudly.

02:49.280 --> 02:50.060
Your Highness,

02:50.240 --> 02:51.890
Ao Jia faces you in dragon form,

02:51.910 --> 02:53.500
already forsaking all brotherly ties.

02:53.710 --> 02:54.690
He treats you this way,

02:54.710 --> 02:56.660
so why go easy on him?

02:57.910 --> 03:00.220
You could actually

03:00.240 --> 03:00.980
pull off an advanced spell

03:01.000 --> 03:03.010
like Voice Transmission.

03:03.080 --> 03:04.690
The Human Clan's strength
can't be underestimated.

03:04.710 --> 03:05.500
No, no.

03:06.240 --> 03:07.010
Well.

03:07.590 --> 03:09.500
I've got something to take care of.

03:09.520 --> 03:10.340
You two,

03:11.710 --> 03:12.850
stick to the plan.

03:17.000 --> 03:17.850
What's wrong with him?

03:19.190 --> 03:20.130
This is just how he is.

03:20.630 --> 03:22.290
What he loves most is
giving others credit.

03:22.310 --> 03:24.410
What he hates most is being praised.

03:24.800 --> 03:25.570
Junior.

03:26.910 --> 03:27.690
Junior.

03:28.710 --> 03:29.260
Senior...

03:29.280 --> 03:29.980
Senior.

03:30.590 --> 03:31.570
What about the Second Prince?

03:31.590 --> 03:32.060
Today, I...

03:32.080 --> 03:33.660
I told you to distract everyone.

03:33.680 --> 03:34.610
What did you do?

03:34.910 --> 03:35.660
I...

03:35.680 --> 03:37.100
What exactly did you do?

03:37.520 --> 03:38.690
I just walked over there

03:38.710 --> 03:40.290
and waved at that paper puppet,

03:40.310 --> 03:41.500
and the next second, it exploded.

03:41.520 --> 03:42.540
I didn't do a thing.

03:43.430 --> 03:44.450
Exploding paper puppets.

03:46.400 --> 03:47.660
Those are all my tricks.

03:48.470 --> 03:50.690
Who knows me this well,

03:51.240 --> 03:52.940
acting on my exact plans beforehand?

03:53.870 --> 03:55.500
It's like a heart-to-heart connection.

03:59.840 --> 04:00.890
A heart-to-heart connection.

04:01.800 --> 04:03.610
This armor protects against any blade.

04:04.000 --> 04:05.220
It's a rare treasure indeed.

04:05.400 --> 04:07.220
Didn't Fairy Yunxiao come by once?

04:07.240 --> 04:08.690
The Court's weapons
and magic instruments

04:08.710 --> 04:09.850
were all taken.

04:09.910 --> 04:11.980
You could actually

04:12.000 --> 04:12.850
pull off an advanced spell

04:12.870 --> 04:14.500
like Voice Transmission.

04:14.520 --> 04:17.020
The formation is complete.
Tell the Little Prince to transform now.

04:25.720 --> 04:26.900
I see.

04:27.310 --> 04:28.410
It's a heart-to-heart connection.

04:29.000 --> 04:29.700
Junior,

04:29.720 --> 04:31.290
we share a heart-to-heart connection!

04:33.120 --> 04:34.140
A heart-to-heart connection.

04:35.480 --> 04:36.610
A heart-to-heart connection?

04:38.720 --> 04:40.290
We share a heart-to-heart connection?

04:41.920 --> 04:43.050
I don't feel it.

04:43.120 --> 04:44.050
Is he talking about him and me?

04:45.980 --> 04:48.820
[Episode 24]

05:11.510 --> 05:12.460
Watch closely.

05:12.800 --> 05:13.580
Yes.

05:18.720 --> 05:20.410
The Sword fragment surfaced.

05:20.680 --> 05:22.100
Ao Yi will soon seize power.

05:22.430 --> 05:23.930
Westdawn Sect will surely lose patience.

05:24.480 --> 05:25.490
Within three days,

05:25.600 --> 05:27.100
they'll come for the Sword.

05:27.270 --> 05:28.900
Be ready to fight at any moment.

05:30.120 --> 05:31.290
Changshou, rest assured.

05:31.920 --> 05:33.340
I've cultivated for a millennium,

05:33.680 --> 05:35.730
yet my magic only served
to arrange marriages.

05:35.920 --> 05:38.490
Today, I can finally act
like a real man

05:38.510 --> 05:39.370
and have a real fight.

05:39.390 --> 05:40.730
When I give the order,

05:41.070 --> 05:42.290
you open the scroll.

05:42.310 --> 05:43.020
Don't worry.

05:43.040 --> 05:43.900
Just go for it.

05:45.120 --> 05:46.290
Open it; don't aim at me.

05:46.310 --> 05:46.900
Aim it outside.

05:46.920 --> 05:47.580
You go ahead.

05:47.600 --> 05:49.100
I didn't tell you to open it now.

05:49.120 --> 05:49.490
All right.

05:50.120 --> 05:51.580
Stay calm. Stay calm.

05:52.510 --> 05:54.460
I'm calm. I'm calm.

05:54.830 --> 05:55.610
I'm calm.

05:57.920 --> 05:59.340
I'll remind you once more.

05:59.920 --> 06:03.020
One move makes or breaks it.

06:03.800 --> 06:05.290
The day Westdawn Sect moves,

06:05.310 --> 06:08.020
the Dragon Palace bows
to the Celestial Court,

06:09.070 --> 06:11.290
and that's when I rise.

06:19.190 --> 06:20.140
What's wrong, Changshou?

06:20.310 --> 06:21.810
A powerful surge of spiritual power

06:22.870 --> 06:24.340
is attacking my paper butterflies.

06:25.190 --> 06:26.540
Then are your butterflies all right?

07:37.430 --> 07:38.490
A thousand years ago,

07:38.920 --> 07:41.730
the Celestial Court
left the Sea-Calming Pillar

07:41.750 --> 07:43.700
but took away the Primordial Sword.

07:44.240 --> 07:45.900
The message is this:

07:46.430 --> 07:49.850
If the Dragon Palace
of the East Sea ever disobeys,

07:49.870 --> 07:51.660
they can open the Eye of the Sea

07:51.830 --> 07:53.050
and doom the East Sea at any time.

07:53.390 --> 07:54.410
But what happened today?

07:55.040 --> 07:58.100
The Celestial Court gave me
a fragment of the Primordial Sword.

07:58.480 --> 08:02.050
It shows unmatched trust and sincerity.

08:02.510 --> 08:04.850
They believe that with me here,

08:05.270 --> 08:06.850
the Eye of the Sea will be safe.

08:07.310 --> 08:12.250
If I refuse,
you can't take the fragment.

08:14.190 --> 08:17.050
Your Majesty, you knew I would come.

08:17.430 --> 08:19.410
You secretly urged my son, Ao Jia,

08:19.430 --> 08:20.810
to claim the East Sea throne.

08:20.830 --> 08:24.100
Then you lured Fairy Yunxiao here
to seize the Sea-Calming Pillar.

08:24.120 --> 08:26.290
Did you think your deeds in the East Sea

08:26.310 --> 08:27.700
would escape my notice?

08:29.390 --> 08:30.900
You noticed long ago.

08:31.800 --> 08:33.700
So, for years, you feigned madness

08:34.510 --> 08:36.010
to keep the First Prince
from the throne.

08:36.480 --> 08:39.820
You also led Fairy Yunxiao
to Bear Island

08:40.320 --> 08:42.010
to protect the Sea-Calming Pillar.

08:43.440 --> 08:45.940
I've been the Dragon King
for a thousand years.

08:46.320 --> 08:48.730
Your petty tricks

08:48.790 --> 08:49.700
are nothing to me.

08:50.030 --> 08:51.100
Your Majesty,

08:51.870 --> 08:52.850
you won't kill me?

08:53.480 --> 08:54.890
If I meant to kill you,

08:55.440 --> 08:56.940
that strike just now

08:57.510 --> 08:59.250
would have left you doomed.

09:02.600 --> 09:03.420
You won't kill me

09:04.840 --> 09:05.820
only because you

09:07.630 --> 09:08.770
need me.

09:10.670 --> 09:12.650
What could I need from you?

09:13.480 --> 09:14.420
The Celestial Court.

09:19.000 --> 09:20.460
After the Deity-Demon War,

09:20.870 --> 09:23.010
the Dragon Clan was granted
the Four Seas.

09:23.480 --> 09:25.250
You're the head of the Dragon Clan.

09:26.150 --> 09:28.650
You've kept its place independent
for a thousand years

09:29.080 --> 09:30.890
because the Dragon Clan once pledged

09:32.670 --> 09:33.460
to the Demon Clan.

09:34.200 --> 09:35.250
A thousand years ago,

09:36.080 --> 09:39.060
I was the best fighter
of the Demon Emperor.

09:40.000 --> 09:42.490
I still remember

09:43.240 --> 09:46.850
the dread before the Demon Emperor.

09:48.870 --> 09:50.100
So, a thousand years ago,

09:50.550 --> 09:52.060
you turned on the Demon Emperor

09:52.870 --> 09:54.300
and gave the Human Clan a great victory.

09:56.870 --> 09:58.340
You wanted

09:59.720 --> 10:02.730
to let the Dragon Clan be independent

10:03.390 --> 10:04.890
in the world.

10:06.510 --> 10:08.610
So, you want me

10:10.630 --> 10:12.180
to ruin the grand wedding in three days

10:13.630 --> 10:14.850
and drive the Celestial Court

10:15.600 --> 10:16.850
out of the East Sea.

10:19.910 --> 10:20.700
Good.

10:21.750 --> 10:22.650
Very good.

10:25.360 --> 10:26.580
Master Jin Chan,

10:27.080 --> 10:28.060
I was right about you

10:28.870 --> 10:30.850
after all.

10:31.270 --> 10:33.650
Your Majesty, we are foes.

10:34.150 --> 10:35.700
Why are you so sure

10:37.080 --> 10:38.580
I'd agree to help you?

10:38.840 --> 10:41.180
If the Celestial Court steps
into the East Sea,

10:41.200 --> 10:43.820
your sect can't open the Eye of the Sea.

10:46.120 --> 10:49.850
If I agree to fight
the Celestial Court to the death,

10:51.600 --> 10:53.010
even if we barely win,

10:54.030 --> 10:55.980
we'd still have the East Sea
as our enemy.

10:56.480 --> 10:57.650
When the Celestial Court comes,

10:57.870 --> 10:59.770
I can simply withdraw first.

11:01.080 --> 11:03.180
Why exhaust myself in a battle here?

11:06.440 --> 11:08.010
I can give you a reason.

11:11.320 --> 11:12.100
This.

11:13.790 --> 11:16.650
If you help me drive out
the Celestial Court,

11:16.670 --> 11:19.100
this Sword fragment will be yours.

11:22.870 --> 11:24.220
The Dragon Clan of the Four Seas

11:24.910 --> 11:28.250
all think you've lost
your mind with age.

11:28.870 --> 11:29.940
But in my eyes,

11:30.720 --> 11:33.700
you hide the deepest schemes

11:34.320 --> 11:36.220
across the Four Seas.

11:37.910 --> 11:38.700
Very well.

11:39.440 --> 11:40.340
In three days,

11:40.960 --> 11:42.100
I will return.

11:49.000 --> 11:50.530
You're having second thoughts?

11:51.120 --> 11:51.890
No.

11:53.240 --> 11:54.650
You have shown me true sincerity.

11:55.910 --> 11:57.850
I should offer a gift in return.

12:00.270 --> 12:02.460
My Dragon Palace lacks no treasure.

12:02.480 --> 12:03.700
We need no gift from you.

12:08.910 --> 12:10.300
The Chaos Bell.

12:13.630 --> 12:16.130
In three days, if you are defeated,

12:16.270 --> 12:18.890
this will be your sole chance
to turn the tide.

12:19.510 --> 12:20.420
Your Majesty,

12:21.240 --> 12:22.610
don't miss this opportunity.

12:25.510 --> 12:26.940
The Chaos Bell.

12:35.870 --> 12:37.370
Why hasn't Senior returned yet?

12:46.630 --> 12:47.420
Senior?

12:48.390 --> 12:49.610
Senior, is that you?

12:49.870 --> 12:50.650
I'm here.

12:55.080 --> 12:55.850
Senior?

12:56.910 --> 12:57.700
Senior?

13:01.200 --> 13:01.980
Senior?

13:07.120 --> 13:08.130
It's not Senior.

13:10.960 --> 13:11.850
What's this? Stop!

13:11.870 --> 13:12.700
Quick, catch him!

13:12.720 --> 13:14.060
He's escaping! Quick!

13:14.080 --> 13:14.770
Get her!

13:15.790 --> 13:17.580
If you don't work hard today,

13:17.600 --> 13:20.130
the East Sea won't be vibrant tomorrow.

13:20.600 --> 13:22.250
Their lions are not good enough,

13:22.270 --> 13:23.820
because they haven't learned from me.

13:27.320 --> 13:28.220
Make way!

13:28.320 --> 13:29.100
Out of the way!

13:31.360 --> 13:31.820
Go!

13:37.080 --> 13:38.530
They're so odd.

13:43.600 --> 13:45.490
They look truly overjoyed.

13:46.120 --> 13:46.890
Maybe we

13:47.360 --> 13:48.730
should join them?

13:52.270 --> 13:53.060
Tomorrow?

13:53.790 --> 13:54.980
Sure!

13:58.960 --> 13:59.650
What's wrong?

13:59.670 --> 14:01.300
Ascendance disciple Lan Ling'e

14:01.320 --> 14:02.980
has been seized by Dragon Palace guards.

14:03.080 --> 14:04.580
The Turtle Minister
invites all honored guests

14:04.600 --> 14:05.940
to the Crystal Palace for a talk.

14:06.390 --> 14:07.180
What did you say?

14:07.200 --> 14:08.370
You took Ling'e!

14:08.870 --> 14:10.220
Bring the prisoner.

14:11.390 --> 14:12.180
Senior.

14:12.550 --> 14:13.530
Junior Ling'e.

14:13.550 --> 14:14.340
Kneel!

14:16.120 --> 14:16.890
Senior...

14:17.840 --> 14:20.420
You guys are honored guests.

14:20.440 --> 14:23.220
We shouldn't have stirred up conflict,

14:23.510 --> 14:27.060
but this one crept
into the palace depths

14:27.080 --> 14:29.300
and shattered a glazed lantern.

14:29.320 --> 14:30.300
I didn't shatter it.

14:30.320 --> 14:31.370
Then who did?

14:31.720 --> 14:34.700
And why sneak into the depths?

14:34.720 --> 14:35.980
What are you plotting?

14:36.080 --> 14:37.770
I didn't... I...

14:37.840 --> 14:39.580
Senior, what do we do?

14:40.750 --> 14:41.530
Just say the word,

14:41.550 --> 14:42.580
and I'll go save her right now.

14:42.600 --> 14:43.700
Don't rush in just yet.

14:43.790 --> 14:44.580
Let's watch a bit longer.

14:44.600 --> 14:45.250
Wait.

14:47.000 --> 14:47.770
Father,

14:48.200 --> 14:50.700
could this be a misunderstanding?

14:50.870 --> 14:52.100
It's just a glazed lantern.

14:52.120 --> 14:52.420
Yes, exactly.

14:52.750 --> 14:53.650
How could it come to this?

14:54.480 --> 14:55.610
Yi,

14:55.910 --> 14:58.770
that's my favorite glazed lantern!

14:59.510 --> 15:02.490
She's broken
His Majesty's glazed lantern.

15:02.510 --> 15:04.980
Next, she'll burn the Dragon Throne!

15:05.000 --> 15:05.370
I...

15:05.390 --> 15:06.580
What kind of reasoning is that?

15:06.790 --> 15:07.580
Father.

15:08.510 --> 15:10.610
Ascendance disciples are good people.

15:10.630 --> 15:11.940
They would never damage

15:11.960 --> 15:13.650
anything here.

15:14.360 --> 15:16.010
Please trust me, Father.

15:16.150 --> 15:17.250
Something's off.

15:17.480 --> 15:19.890
- How can you trust humans?
- It's indeed fishy.

15:19.910 --> 15:21.530
The Dragon King owns all of Lotus Hall.

15:21.750 --> 15:23.580
Why would he care
about one glazed lantern?

15:24.670 --> 15:26.130
Junior is the suspicious one.

15:26.150 --> 15:27.060
Who are you talking about?

15:27.120 --> 15:28.370
If you mean no harm,

15:28.550 --> 15:30.370
why sneak deep into the Dragon Palace?

15:30.390 --> 15:31.460
What's your aim?

15:31.870 --> 15:32.580
Good question.

15:32.600 --> 15:34.250
- There's surely something shady.
- Whose side are you on?

15:35.240 --> 15:36.060
Our side.

15:36.440 --> 15:37.820
I'm here to catch the villain.

15:38.720 --> 15:39.730
Catch a villain?

15:40.030 --> 15:40.980
I saw someone

15:41.000 --> 15:42.340
sneaking into the Dragon Palace.

15:42.360 --> 15:43.770
Worried for Little Prince's safety,

15:43.790 --> 15:45.060
I followed them in secret.

15:45.120 --> 15:46.010
They're the ones who broke
the glazed lantern.

15:46.030 --> 15:46.940
It has nothing to do with me.

15:46.960 --> 15:47.730
Describe it then.

15:48.360 --> 15:50.180
What did the figure look like?

15:50.480 --> 15:51.460
I only saw their back,

15:51.480 --> 15:52.490
not their face.

15:52.600 --> 15:53.460
Their back?

15:53.720 --> 15:55.370
Even a back shows human or dragon.

15:55.510 --> 15:56.770
Any dragon features?

16:03.360 --> 16:04.060
Your Majesty,

16:04.080 --> 16:05.300
they were a human, not a dragon.

16:10.200 --> 16:13.220
We have only one exit.

16:13.790 --> 16:14.580
Turtle Minister,

16:14.670 --> 16:17.580
aside from Yi returning yesterday,

16:17.600 --> 16:18.700
in the past half-month,

16:19.080 --> 16:20.580
was the Water Dragon Spout opened?

16:20.600 --> 16:22.250
No, Your Majesty. It wasn't.

16:23.200 --> 16:24.460
Those entering the East Sea

16:24.480 --> 16:26.130
were all brought by the Little Prince.

16:26.360 --> 16:29.980
Last night,
guards combed the Dragon Palace

16:30.000 --> 16:31.130
but found no outsider.

16:31.150 --> 16:32.180
So, it's clear:

16:32.270 --> 16:34.820
This woman keeps spouting nonsense.

16:35.200 --> 16:36.490
Your Majesty, everything I said is true.

16:36.510 --> 16:38.010
Please believe me, Your Majesty.

16:43.200 --> 16:44.220
Turtle Minister,

16:44.240 --> 16:45.700
lock her up in the dungeon first.

16:45.720 --> 16:46.300
Father.

16:46.320 --> 16:47.370
Enough, Yi.

16:47.390 --> 16:49.010
Tomorrow is your grand wedding.

16:49.030 --> 16:51.300
Why let her ruin it?

16:51.320 --> 16:53.490
Turtle Minister,
take her to the dungeon.

16:53.510 --> 16:55.940
I'll deal with this
after the grand wedding.

16:56.120 --> 16:56.730
Aunt.

16:57.240 --> 16:58.010
Don't be impulsive.

16:58.080 --> 16:59.580
If we don't save her now,
she's done for.

17:00.390 --> 17:01.180
No, no.

17:01.320 --> 17:01.980
Senior, Aunt.

17:02.000 --> 17:02.420
Junior.

17:02.750 --> 17:03.420
Junior.

17:03.960 --> 17:04.490
Senior.

17:07.880 --> 17:08.860
Improve yourself.

17:09.350 --> 17:10.330
Turn over a new leaf.

17:10.350 --> 17:11.380
Get tortured.

17:12.270 --> 17:12.730
Junior.

17:12.750 --> 17:13.250
Ling'e.

17:13.270 --> 17:13.770
Junior.

17:26.920 --> 17:27.330
No.

17:27.960 --> 17:28.980
I must see the Dragon King

17:29.110 --> 17:29.980
to rescue Ling'e.

17:30.000 --> 17:30.620
Aunt.

17:30.640 --> 17:31.490
Aunt, you mustn't!

17:31.510 --> 17:32.940
What are we waiting for?

17:33.070 --> 17:33.980
We came here

17:34.030 --> 17:35.940
to foil the Westdawn Sect's plot.

17:36.000 --> 17:37.810
If we fight the Dragon Palace now,

17:37.830 --> 17:39.700
we'd give Westdawn an opening.

17:39.720 --> 17:40.660
I know, but Ling'e...

17:40.680 --> 17:41.420
Aunt.

17:42.000 --> 17:43.490
If Uncle Jiu Wu were here,

17:43.750 --> 17:44.700
what would he do?

18:01.400 --> 18:02.180
Changshou,

18:02.920 --> 18:04.010
you're the cleverest.

18:05.240 --> 18:06.570
What should we do then?

18:07.350 --> 18:08.180
I'll follow your lead.

18:09.590 --> 18:10.490
Junior said

18:11.510 --> 18:13.570
she saw a mysterious figure.

18:14.790 --> 18:17.290
A mysterious person broke
the glazed lantern.

18:17.400 --> 18:19.250
Junior Ling'e may be quirky,

18:19.310 --> 18:21.250
but she's not one to make things up.

18:21.270 --> 18:23.380
I believe she saw someone.

18:23.400 --> 18:24.490
I believe her too.

18:25.030 --> 18:27.770
But everyone says no one else was there.

18:28.350 --> 18:31.330
The point isn't whether it's true

18:31.720 --> 18:34.530
but how to make everyone believe

18:34.550 --> 18:36.460
that this mystery person exists.

18:36.680 --> 18:38.570
If we don't find this mystery person,

18:38.640 --> 18:39.860
then we can

18:40.400 --> 18:42.090
create a mysterious figure

18:42.830 --> 18:44.940
so we can show everyone
that in the Dragon Palace,

18:44.960 --> 18:46.980
such a person really exists.

18:49.070 --> 18:49.860
Wouldn't that solve it?

19:00.510 --> 19:01.220
Senior,

19:01.790 --> 19:03.490
our Skyrend's magic arts

19:03.960 --> 19:05.770
are all righteous divine abilities.

19:06.590 --> 19:08.770
You want me to pose
as a mystery man to assassinate?

19:08.920 --> 19:09.490
I...

19:10.400 --> 19:11.660
I have no confidence.

19:12.000 --> 19:13.050
Junior Xuanya,

19:13.110 --> 19:15.730
I understand all your concerns.

19:16.030 --> 19:18.010
After all, under normal circumstances,

19:18.030 --> 19:21.090
this work is usually done
by Junior Ling'e.

19:21.110 --> 19:22.570
But she's not here right now,

19:23.000 --> 19:26.570
so I can only pick you

19:28.000 --> 19:29.250
or Aunt Jiu Jiu.

19:34.750 --> 19:36.140
It can only be you.

19:36.160 --> 19:37.700
You're the only one for this job.

19:37.790 --> 19:38.660
No one else can do it.

19:40.070 --> 19:41.420
To save Junior Ling'e,

19:41.440 --> 19:42.860
we must make the Dragon Clan believe

19:42.880 --> 19:44.290
there's a mysterious person
in the Dragon Palace.

19:44.510 --> 19:45.490
You pick a target.

19:45.790 --> 19:47.900
Just make a failed attempt.

19:48.030 --> 19:48.810
Go for it.

19:49.750 --> 19:51.810
But the Dragon Palace
is heavily guarded.

19:51.830 --> 19:53.380
Guards patrol closely.

19:53.400 --> 19:53.810
I...

19:55.000 --> 19:56.380
I can't sneak in.

19:56.640 --> 19:57.770
Leave that to me.

20:45.590 --> 20:47.220
Lost and found!

20:47.680 --> 20:48.700
Let me see.

20:49.790 --> 20:50.570
You...

20:51.590 --> 20:53.290
You'll get it when I'm done.

20:54.110 --> 20:55.490
Hurry up then.

20:56.750 --> 20:57.530
Success.

20:59.270 --> 21:00.180
What success?

21:00.480 --> 21:02.460
You little rascal, what's your scheme?

21:02.480 --> 21:03.380
Do you still need me?

21:03.400 --> 21:04.980
Aunt.

21:05.200 --> 21:07.220
You'll be very useful later.

21:08.920 --> 21:09.770
Let me out!

21:09.790 --> 21:11.570
You thick-headed, blind dragons!

21:11.590 --> 21:13.180
We're here to rescue you.

21:13.200 --> 21:14.380
Why lock me up here?

21:14.640 --> 21:16.330
Anyone there? Let me out!

21:21.000 --> 21:21.770
Senior.

21:22.400 --> 21:24.290
When will you come save me?

21:24.750 --> 21:26.570
Make sure she improves herself

21:27.200 --> 21:28.380
and turns over a new leaf.

21:30.110 --> 21:31.180
Torture her!

21:33.440 --> 21:36.090
Stupid Senior! Wicked Senior!

21:36.110 --> 21:37.570
Scoundrel Senior.

21:41.400 --> 21:42.140
Young lady,

21:42.480 --> 21:43.620
who are you calling Senior?

21:45.350 --> 21:46.570
I'm not your Senior.

21:47.310 --> 21:49.380
Are you tired of shouting?

21:49.750 --> 21:51.660
If so, come with me.

21:52.000 --> 21:53.980
I thought the execution was
after the wedding.

21:54.030 --> 21:55.180
Don't be so hasty.

21:55.200 --> 21:56.250
I'm still young.

21:58.790 --> 21:59.570
So young.

22:02.920 --> 22:04.620
Assassinating at the Dragon Palace

22:05.000 --> 22:06.290
is surprisingly hard.

22:07.000 --> 22:08.900
This must be a trial from Senior.

22:09.070 --> 22:10.420
I won't disappoint him.

22:13.270 --> 22:14.860
I'm still young and beautiful.

22:15.000 --> 22:16.490
I'm still in the bloom of youth.

22:16.790 --> 22:18.770
I've never been in love!

22:18.790 --> 22:19.810
Turtle Minister.

22:20.790 --> 22:22.180
That is indeed a pity.

22:22.350 --> 22:24.420
Listen. Love is really fun.

22:25.480 --> 22:26.250
Well.

22:27.400 --> 22:29.570
You two, step outside.

22:29.590 --> 22:30.980
Guard the door.

22:31.400 --> 22:32.180
Yes.

22:33.200 --> 22:33.980
No.

22:34.440 --> 22:35.140
What's that supposed to mean?

22:35.160 --> 22:35.770
Please.

22:47.830 --> 22:50.570
I'll be killed after I've had my fill?

22:50.590 --> 22:52.860
Right, it's like a buffet.

22:53.400 --> 22:54.180
Got it.

22:54.200 --> 22:55.420
Then I won't hold back.

23:09.070 --> 23:09.860
Shh.

23:24.920 --> 23:25.770
Is it good?

23:27.550 --> 23:28.490
Your Majesty, Your Majesty.

23:28.510 --> 23:30.050
Miss, don't be afraid.

23:30.200 --> 23:32.570
I prepared these for you.

23:32.590 --> 23:34.700
Eat and drink to your heart's content.

23:36.000 --> 23:36.490
Really?

23:37.920 --> 23:38.730
Then I'll dig in.

23:51.160 --> 23:52.050
What are you doing?

23:54.350 --> 23:55.180
Your Majesty, well.

23:55.200 --> 23:56.050
Don't come any closer.

23:56.070 --> 23:57.220
I only had a few bites of your food.

23:57.240 --> 23:58.290
I can spit it out.

23:58.310 --> 23:59.770
And you just told me to eat it.

23:59.790 --> 24:01.330
Don't come closer!

24:01.440 --> 24:02.570
Help!

24:10.000 --> 24:10.980
What the hell is this?

24:11.590 --> 24:13.140
It's indeed the Chaos Bell!

24:23.200 --> 24:24.810
Where did you get this?

24:25.270 --> 24:26.700
It's a keepsake from my mother.

24:27.590 --> 24:28.010
You...

24:28.920 --> 24:30.090
Who are you?

24:32.200 --> 24:33.290
I'm Lan Ling'e,

24:33.400 --> 24:35.090
a disciple of Jade Division,
Ascendance Sect.

24:35.200 --> 24:36.860
Lan Ling'e.

24:42.750 --> 24:43.460
What are you laughing at?

24:43.480 --> 24:44.530
That's the truth.

24:44.550 --> 24:47.010
Miss, you seem unaware

24:47.030 --> 24:48.860
of your true identity.

24:48.880 --> 24:51.050
How could a mere Ascendance disciple

24:51.350 --> 24:53.140
wear the Chaos Bell?

24:57.200 --> 24:58.570
My true identity?

24:59.750 --> 25:01.530
Do you not know your origins?

25:23.240 --> 25:24.180
You're also

25:25.030 --> 25:26.330
here for the assassination?

25:27.790 --> 25:28.810
You too?

25:33.270 --> 25:34.050
Assassination?

25:35.200 --> 25:35.980
Exactly.

25:36.920 --> 25:39.380
I hid you in the East Sea
for half a month

25:40.070 --> 25:41.570
for this very plan.

25:43.070 --> 25:44.980
Changgeng's whole setup in the East Sea

25:45.160 --> 25:46.810
revolves around Ao Yi.

25:48.110 --> 25:50.050
If we can eliminate Ao Yi,

25:50.920 --> 25:54.290
Changgeng will have no moves left.

25:56.000 --> 25:57.570
Changgeng.

25:58.590 --> 25:59.380
Relax.

26:00.000 --> 26:02.010
Leave this to me.

26:02.110 --> 26:03.050
Remember:

26:03.640 --> 26:05.180
Act in secret.

26:06.200 --> 26:07.980
Don't let the Dragon Clan

26:08.030 --> 26:09.700
know we're behind this.

26:10.790 --> 26:11.770
Better yet,

26:12.240 --> 26:14.620
frame the Ascendance Sect.

26:17.160 --> 26:18.050
How do I pull that off?

26:24.200 --> 26:25.460
I have a plan.

26:26.200 --> 26:29.050
You just do your best.

26:35.240 --> 26:37.180
I knew he had a plan.

26:37.200 --> 26:37.860
I knew

26:37.880 --> 26:39.620
he wouldn't have me attempt this alone.

26:41.680 --> 26:42.730
He?

26:44.480 --> 26:47.940
Did Senior send you to meet me?

26:48.640 --> 26:49.420
Senior?

26:52.590 --> 26:54.140
You call him Senior?

26:55.000 --> 26:56.180
So, you're a fellow cultivator.

26:56.440 --> 26:57.530
My apologies. My apologies.

26:59.310 --> 27:00.660
Since we're fellow cultivators,

27:00.830 --> 27:02.090
there's no need for such formality.

27:02.880 --> 27:03.660
But

27:04.110 --> 27:06.530
how come I've never seen you before?

27:08.200 --> 27:08.980
Your Senior

27:10.270 --> 27:12.220
hid me in the East Sea half a month ago.

27:12.240 --> 27:13.570
He told me to stay out of sight

27:13.590 --> 27:14.810
and keep to the shadows.

27:14.830 --> 27:16.180
That's why none of you have seen me.

27:18.400 --> 27:21.770
So, Senior had this planned all along.

27:22.270 --> 27:24.940
Truly far-sighted. Impressive.

27:26.880 --> 27:28.980
Don't let the Dragon Clan

27:29.270 --> 27:30.570
know we're behind this.

27:31.590 --> 27:32.380
Better yet,

27:33.440 --> 27:35.570
frame the Ascendance Sect.

27:39.160 --> 27:40.530
Brilliant!

27:40.640 --> 27:42.010
I never imagined your disguise

27:42.030 --> 27:43.460
could be so masterful.

27:43.750 --> 27:46.010
It's seamless, absolutely lifelike.

27:46.030 --> 27:47.730
I can't find a single flaw.

27:50.200 --> 27:52.380
This is but an ordinary disguise.

27:52.400 --> 27:53.490
Ordinary?

27:57.590 --> 27:58.380
Listen.

27:59.000 --> 28:00.940
With this disguise, the assassination

28:01.160 --> 28:03.140
will surely mislead the Dragon Palace.

28:05.000 --> 28:06.180
As Senior said,

28:06.720 --> 28:09.380
I want the Dragon Palace
to mistake me for the assassin.

28:09.510 --> 28:11.180
That is exactly the goal.

28:14.440 --> 28:17.220
His schemes are truly brilliant.

28:17.480 --> 28:19.250
Each plan is so meticulously arranged.

28:20.200 --> 28:20.980
Miss,

28:21.240 --> 28:23.250
I've already scouted the road ahead.

28:23.920 --> 28:25.180
For this assassination,

28:26.310 --> 28:28.090
allow me to guide you.

28:28.550 --> 28:30.290
With you leading the way,

28:30.510 --> 28:31.860
I'm much relieved.

28:34.510 --> 28:35.090
Please.

28:48.920 --> 28:49.660
Shh.

28:54.920 --> 28:55.660
Sir,

28:56.590 --> 28:58.900
who exactly are we assassinating?

29:01.400 --> 29:02.180
What?

29:03.070 --> 29:05.660
He didn't tell you?

29:06.720 --> 29:08.290
Senior only told me to assassinate.

29:08.550 --> 29:10.700
But he didn't say who the target was.

29:12.310 --> 29:13.570
I see.

29:14.310 --> 29:15.980
None of us knows the full plan.

29:16.000 --> 29:16.900
This way, if anyone is exposed,

29:16.920 --> 29:18.140
there's still a chance to recover.

29:18.550 --> 29:19.770
He is

29:20.310 --> 29:21.980
indeed cautious.

29:22.310 --> 29:23.770
I see.

29:24.440 --> 29:26.420
Only Senior could plan like this.

29:26.480 --> 29:27.940
Truly unfathomable.

29:28.920 --> 29:29.770
Listen carefully.

29:30.590 --> 29:32.290
Our target for this assassination is

29:33.790 --> 29:35.530
the Second Prince, Ao Yi.

29:37.200 --> 29:37.980
Ao Yi?

29:40.590 --> 29:42.050
I see.

29:42.750 --> 29:45.010
Given the Little Prince's ties
to Ascendance Sect,

29:45.200 --> 29:46.980
Senior must have arranged this.

29:47.200 --> 29:48.940
He is surely the best choice.

29:48.960 --> 29:49.660
Exactly.

29:50.030 --> 29:51.770
With the Second Prince's ties
to Ascendance Sect,

29:51.790 --> 29:53.770
he is the most fitting candidate.

29:54.200 --> 29:54.980
Then let's act now.

29:55.000 --> 29:55.810
Let's do it.

29:55.830 --> 29:56.810
Go!

30:02.920 --> 30:05.010
Oh, no, no!

30:07.240 --> 30:10.010
Ling'e was wronged
for trying to catch a spy

30:10.240 --> 30:11.180
within our Dragon Palace.

30:11.200 --> 30:13.380
How can I just abandon her?

30:13.680 --> 30:15.660
Ling'e, I'm coming for you!

30:37.110 --> 30:38.010
He's coming out!

30:38.640 --> 30:39.810
This is our perfect chance to act.

30:39.830 --> 30:41.860
This must be Senior's design.

30:42.640 --> 30:43.900
I see.

30:44.590 --> 30:45.380
Let's go.

31:10.400 --> 31:12.010
The East Sea's Wasteland is vast.

31:12.550 --> 31:13.770
Even footsteps echo here.

31:44.310 --> 31:45.770
Not a single guard in sight.

31:47.920 --> 31:49.140
So, the Dragon Clan's restoration

31:49.750 --> 31:50.900
brooks no delay.

31:56.200 --> 31:58.530
Ling'e, it's Ao Yi.

31:58.550 --> 31:59.460
I've come to rescue you.

32:00.000 --> 32:00.620
Miss,

32:01.440 --> 32:02.770
now's the perfect time.

32:03.830 --> 32:05.900
Perfect? Really?

32:07.440 --> 32:08.660
No one's around.

32:09.160 --> 32:10.050
Perfect to strike.

32:11.830 --> 32:13.140
No one's around?

32:13.750 --> 32:15.050
That's precisely why we shouldn't.

32:15.350 --> 32:16.140
No.

32:16.880 --> 32:18.140
What kind of logic is that?

32:21.790 --> 32:24.980
You want to assassinate in public?

32:26.590 --> 32:27.380
Of course.

32:27.400 --> 32:29.140
Otherwise,
why attempt this assassination?

32:36.790 --> 32:37.570
My fellow cultivator,

32:37.590 --> 32:39.010
I understand that as an assassin,

32:39.030 --> 32:40.250
you have your own artistic vision.

32:40.400 --> 32:42.460
But please respect my professionalism.

32:42.750 --> 32:43.380
Here's the plan.

32:43.400 --> 32:44.090
In a moment,

32:44.640 --> 32:45.490
you keep watch here.

32:45.510 --> 32:47.460
I'll perform the assassination, got it?

32:47.720 --> 32:49.290
Got it. I'll go gather an audience.

32:50.880 --> 32:52.180
Why gather an audience?

32:52.200 --> 32:53.570
To watch you perform the assassination!

32:53.590 --> 32:54.180
You're crazy!

32:54.200 --> 32:55.250
Shh.

32:58.200 --> 32:59.700
Alright, let's both calm down.

32:59.720 --> 33:01.180
Just wait here for a moment,

33:01.200 --> 33:01.940
and watch me perform.

33:01.940 --> 33:02.200
But...

33:02.200 --> 33:04.220
No buts, listen to me.

33:07.110 --> 33:07.900
Amateur.

33:14.750 --> 33:15.530
Ling'e.

33:16.310 --> 33:17.220
Ling'e.

33:17.880 --> 33:18.900
I'm Ao Yi.

33:19.160 --> 33:20.140
I've come to rescue you.

33:24.350 --> 33:25.140
Le'er.

33:25.400 --> 33:25.660
Who's there?

33:26.030 --> 33:26.770
Assassin!

33:26.790 --> 33:28.620
Guards! Catch the assassin!

33:29.030 --> 33:29.980
Assassin!

33:31.030 --> 33:32.420
Completing the mission this way,

33:32.440 --> 33:33.700
you are truly unpredictable.

33:33.720 --> 33:35.050
Guards! Catch the assassin!

33:35.720 --> 33:36.460
Don't run!

33:38.590 --> 33:39.090
Stop!

33:39.110 --> 33:39.770
Assassin!

33:39.920 --> 33:40.180
Run!

33:40.880 --> 33:41.620
Assassin!

33:44.110 --> 33:45.940
Guards! Catch the assassin!

33:49.070 --> 33:49.810
Don't run!

33:51.480 --> 33:52.050
Oh, no.

33:52.720 --> 33:54.770
What if that cultivator thinks
Le'er is the Second Prince?

33:56.510 --> 33:57.380
The Chaos Bell

33:58.110 --> 33:59.570
is a primordial supreme treasure.

33:59.880 --> 34:02.090
It can suppress the chaotic world

34:02.110 --> 34:04.290
and bend time and space.

34:04.310 --> 34:06.420
But after the Deity-Demon War,

34:07.110 --> 34:09.050
it vanished without a trace.

34:09.320 --> 34:11.820
It has not been seen
for a thousand years,

34:13.440 --> 34:16.170
until you appeared.

34:19.190 --> 34:20.570
Isn't this just a bell?

34:20.800 --> 34:21.780
Is it really so mystical?

34:24.630 --> 34:25.420
Miss,

34:26.230 --> 34:27.740
when you wear this bell,

34:28.880 --> 34:30.690
at the brink of life and death,

34:31.400 --> 34:34.420
have you noticed anything odd?

34:37.070 --> 34:38.530
Anything odd?

34:56.190 --> 34:57.170
The Chaos Bell?

35:03.110 --> 35:05.340
The Chaos Bell can bend time and space.

35:06.480 --> 35:09.170
But your spiritual power is too shallow.

35:09.840 --> 35:11.420
It can only turn back a moment.

35:12.030 --> 35:14.050
But if the Chaos Bell's original owner

35:14.670 --> 35:16.940
activates the Chaos Bell's power,

35:17.550 --> 35:20.090
they can travel back a thousand years.

35:21.880 --> 35:23.380
The Chaos Bell's original owner?

35:27.590 --> 35:28.530
I've worn this bell

35:28.800 --> 35:30.690
since I was a child.

35:31.230 --> 35:34.090
My mother said it was a keepsake
from my father.

35:44.710 --> 35:45.490
A resemblance...

35:47.000 --> 35:47.980
So alike.

35:48.550 --> 35:50.980
Resemblance in brow and eyes.

35:51.000 --> 35:51.780
Resemble who?

35:51.840 --> 35:53.170
The Chaos Bell's original owner.

35:53.550 --> 35:55.490
Your birth father.

36:04.320 --> 36:05.130
Where is he?

36:13.800 --> 36:14.570
Le'er, watch out!

36:21.150 --> 36:21.940
My father?

36:24.030 --> 36:25.170
You know my father?

36:25.440 --> 36:26.170
He's still alive?

36:26.190 --> 36:27.570
Then can you take me to see him?

36:27.630 --> 36:28.820
Do you really want to know?

36:29.280 --> 36:30.460
Yes, I'd like to know.

36:30.510 --> 36:32.210
- Alright, your father...
- Your Majesty!

36:32.230 --> 36:33.010
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

36:33.030 --> 36:34.010
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

36:34.030 --> 36:35.460
Good heavens!

36:35.480 --> 36:36.980
Why rush in at a time like this?

36:37.000 --> 36:37.860
Then I'll go.

36:38.000 --> 36:39.170
No, no, Your Majesty.

36:39.590 --> 36:41.090
An assassin has entered the palace.

36:42.630 --> 36:44.050
Catch the assassin!

36:44.190 --> 36:46.010
Catch the assassin!

36:49.070 --> 36:50.210
Audacious assassin!

36:53.590 --> 36:54.380
Warrior Eel.

36:55.550 --> 36:56.460
Your Highness.

36:59.480 --> 37:00.300
Your Highness?

37:01.110 --> 37:01.980
Why is it you?

37:02.000 --> 37:03.820
Why did you try to assassinate?

37:04.800 --> 37:05.690
Assassinate?

37:05.760 --> 37:06.530
Me?

37:07.400 --> 37:08.170
Assassinate whom?

37:08.630 --> 37:09.420
Assassinate...

37:09.590 --> 37:10.650
Assassinate whom?

37:11.000 --> 37:12.570
Who do you mean by that?

37:17.630 --> 37:19.170
What? Miss.

37:19.550 --> 37:20.460
You're so fast.

37:23.190 --> 37:24.050
See you next time.

37:26.230 --> 37:27.260
See you next time.

37:29.230 --> 37:30.010
I never thought

37:30.630 --> 37:33.610
that so many dangers
lurk in the shadows.

37:34.280 --> 37:35.530
All these years,

37:35.760 --> 37:37.860
Senior's always stuck to this principle.

37:38.280 --> 37:39.780
I truly admire that.

37:40.480 --> 37:41.860
Don't praise me now.

37:42.510 --> 37:43.010
Go.

37:44.760 --> 37:45.530
Xuanya.

37:46.630 --> 37:47.420
Willgate,

37:47.440 --> 37:49.340
our Tushita Palace's newest item.

37:49.360 --> 37:50.650
Just in time to use it today.

37:50.840 --> 37:51.860
It seems

37:52.000 --> 37:53.980
today's assassination was a success.

37:54.000 --> 37:55.980
Senior's plan is flawless.

37:56.000 --> 37:58.130
I merely acted according to plan.

38:00.230 --> 38:01.780
Xuanya, you're too modest.

38:01.800 --> 38:03.780
You improvised
to strike the Little Prince,

38:03.800 --> 38:04.820
snatching victory from danger.

38:05.400 --> 38:06.300
Impressive!

38:06.320 --> 38:07.460
Impressive!

38:07.670 --> 38:08.460
No, no.

38:08.480 --> 38:10.690
It all went as Senior planned.

38:10.710 --> 38:12.940
Senior had a cultivator help.

38:13.000 --> 38:15.650
That cultivator was thorough
and convincing.

38:16.440 --> 38:18.170
When he moved to kill the Little Prince,

38:18.230 --> 38:19.490
he truly meant to do it.

38:19.510 --> 38:21.050
You scared me!

38:21.070 --> 38:22.090
In the end, he failed

38:22.230 --> 38:23.380
with a loud wail.

38:23.630 --> 38:25.010
It was seemingly comical,

38:25.030 --> 38:27.900
yet he hid wisdom in folly.

38:28.800 --> 38:30.010
I wish to meet

38:30.360 --> 38:32.780
this cultivator again if I can.

38:40.190 --> 38:41.010
Darn it!

38:41.590 --> 38:43.300
If I could appear,

38:43.880 --> 38:45.820
you'd be no match for me.

38:47.550 --> 38:48.260
Who's there?

38:51.760 --> 38:52.740
Fairy Yunxiao.

39:27.070 --> 39:32.850
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

39:33.520 --> 39:40.220
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

39:41.750 --> 39:47.800
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

39:48.430 --> 39:54.880
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

39:55.620 --> 40:02.740
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

40:03.120 --> 40:10.020
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

40:10.400 --> 40:17.750
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

40:17.750 --> 40:24.920
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

40:41.060 --> 40:46.230
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

40:47.320 --> 40:54.340
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

40:55.530 --> 41:01.470
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

41:02.170 --> 41:09.250
♪Alas, our story is short♪

41:09.590 --> 41:16.700
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

41:17.020 --> 41:23.500
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

41:24.280 --> 41:31.490
♪Tears fall, this fate's not done♪

41:31.880 --> 41:39.700
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
